#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Miki"
msgid "Sir?"
msgstr "¿Jefe?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "The manager said something was up. Everything okay?"
msgstr "¿Está todo bien? El gerente me dijo que te pasaba algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Miki"
msgid "Oh, I don't know..."
msgstr "Hm, lo que pasa es que..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "What is it? You can tell me."
msgstr "¿Qué es? Puedes contarme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Miki"
msgid "You probably didn't know this, but up until recently I had a\\r\nregular named Taniguchi."
msgstr "Quizás no lo sabías pero, hasta hace poco\\r\ntenía a un cliente habitual llamado, Taniguchi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Taniguchi?"
msgstr "¿Taniguchi?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Miki"
msgid "That's right. He was kind of a nerdy creep, but he wound up\\r\nspending a lot of money on me."
msgstr "Sí. Un otaku un poco raro, pero el término gastando\\r\nun montón de dinero en mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Five million yen..."
msgstr "Cinco millones de yenes..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Miki"
msgid "Huh!? So you know about him?"
msgstr "¡¿Eh?! ¿Sabes quién es?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "No, not really... Anyway, what about this Taniguchi guy?"
msgstr "No, la verdad... Pero, ¿Qué pasa con Taniguchi?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Miki"
msgid "Well, he suddenly stopped coming to the club."
msgstr "Bueno, de repente, él dejó de venir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Miki"
msgid "He never struck me as particularly wealthy, so I just\\r\nfigured he finally ran out of money..."
msgstr "Nunca me dio la impresión de que fuera rico, así que\\r\nsolo me imagine que ya se había quedado sin dinero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "And now that Taniguchi's not coming around anymore, you're\\r\ntoo devastated to concentrate on work, is that it?"
msgstr "Y ahora que Taniguchi ya no vuelve, te sientes sola\\r\ny no puedes concentrarte en el trabajo, ¿no es así?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Miki"
msgid "Absolutely not! I wouldn't shed any tears over one or two\\r\nfewer nerdy types in here, trust me."
msgstr "¡No! ¡Nunca! Jamás derramaría ni una sola lágrima\\r\npor algún otaku, te lo aseguro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Akiyama"
msgid "So what is it?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Qué es?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Miki"
msgid "I just saw that dorky Taniguchi walking around looking like\\r\nhe owns the place! It's like he's had a major makeover."
msgstr "¡El otro día, vi a ese tonto de Taniguchi caminando por ahí\\r\nhaciéndose el importante! Es como si hubiera cambiado completamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Miki"
msgid "And what's worse, he had another hostess on his arm!"
msgstr "¡Y lo peor es que, llevaba a otra hostess agarrada del brazo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Miki"
msgid "He didn't run out of money after all."
msgstr "Resulta que, al final, no se había quedado sin dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Miki"
msgid "He changed his image, made himself all cool, then dropped me\\r\nfor some other girl."
msgstr "Cambio su aspecto, se hizo bien guapo, y me dejo tirada\\r\npor otra chica."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "...Surely losing one customer doesn't bother you this much?"
msgstr "...Pero perder un solo cliente, no te es para tanto, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Miki"
msgid "It's a matter of pride!"
msgstr "¡Es una cuestion de orgullo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Miki"
msgid "It's as though somebody told me I was a good match for only\\r\nthe nerdiest customers. I've lost all faith in myself."
msgstr "Es como sí... como sí, alguien me dijera que solo sirvo para atender\\r\na clientes raritos. Ahora, perdí la confianza en mí misma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Miki"
msgid "Now that I think about it, a lot of my customers are kind of weird..."
msgstr "Ahora que lo pienso, mucho de mis clientes lo son..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Akiyama"
msgid "That's not true..."
msgstr "Eso no es verdad..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Miki"
msgid "Fewer and fewer customers ask for me by name. Maybe it's\\r\ntime I leave this job behind..."
msgstr "Cada vez menos y menos clientes piden por mí. Tal vez\\r\nya sea el momento de dejar este trabajo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Akiyama"
msgid "I have an idea! Why don't I give you a refresher course in\\r\nhostessing? Help you boost your confidence!"
msgstr "¡Ya sé! Para ayudarte a recobrar la confianza, te daré\\r\nun curso especial de hostess, ¿Qué te parece?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Miki"
msgid "A refresher course?"
msgstr "¿Un curso especial?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. After all, I'm the one who got you into this mess."
msgstr "Así es, después de todo, yo soy quien te metió en este lío."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Miki"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "Uh, never mind. Anyway, hostesses need to make their\\r\ncustomers fall for them－hard. You know that, right?"
msgstr "Eh, olvídalo. Como te decía, las hostesses necesitan hacer que\\r\nsus clientes caigan por ellas - y mucho. Eso ya lo sabes, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Miki"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Akiyama"
msgid "From what I've seen, you have no problem entertaining\\r\ncustomers in the club."
msgstr "Por lo visto, no tienes ningún problema con\\r\nentretener a los clientes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Miki"
msgid "Then, what am I missing?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Qué me hace falta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Akiyama"
msgid "Are you getting dates after work?"
msgstr "¿Tienes citas despues del trabajo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Miki"
msgid "No, not really..."
msgstr "No, nada..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Akiyama"
msgid "There you go. What you need are dates. Consider them\\r\ninsurance, your backup plan."
msgstr "Eso es. Lo que necesitas son citas. Considéralos como\\r\nun empujón de confianza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Miki"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad lo cree?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Akiyama"
msgid "You bet. Dates are different. It's just you and your\\r\ncustomer, one-on-one."
msgstr "Te lo aseguro. Las citas son otra cosa. Eres tú y el cliente\\r\ncara a cara, sin nada más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Akiyama"
msgid "How a hostess acts and the impression she makes at one of\\r\nthese special events have a big effect on her customer."
msgstr "Como una hostess actúe e impresione al cliente, hará que ese\\r\nmomento tenga un gran impacto en ellos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Miki"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Akiyama"
msgid "How about I give you some tips on how to make a customer\\r\nfall head over heels for you?"
msgstr "Ahora déjame encargarme de todo, te enseñaré unas técnicas para\\r\nque los clientes se arrodillen ante ti. ¿Te parece bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Miki"
msgid "Yes, please!"
msgstr "¡Sí, por favor!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent. Come with me!"
msgstr "Muy bien. ¡Entonces vámonos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Miki"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "¡Sí, señor!"
